<title>JAPAN: Japan T-bill auction likely on Tuesday--traders.</title>
<headline>Japan T-bill auction likely on Tuesday--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) is likely to hold a price-competitive auction of Treasury bills (T-bills) on Tuesday, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>They added that the MOF's offer is likely to be around 1.3 trillion yen worth of three-month T-bills.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8806</p>
</text>
